# Porteos Intelligence — AI Development Rules

## CRITICAL CONTEXT

Before writing ANY UI code, read:

1. `/01_TERMINAL_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` — canonical spec
2. `/DESIGN_EXECUTION_PLAN.md` — phased rollout
3. `PorteosIntelligence/Utilities/DesignTokens.swift` — code tokens
4. `02_DATA_METRICS_AND_LOGIC.md` — formulas

## Core Principles

- Native SwiftUI only (no UIKit wrappers unless required)
- Zero rounded corners: `.clipShape(Rectangle())`
- JetBrains Mono exclusively — `.monospacedDigit()` on all numbers
- State vs Identity: semantic color ONLY on threshold breach
- 8pt grid; fixed row heights from `DesignTokens`
- MVVM with `@Observable` ViewModels

## Color — USE DesignTokens ONLY

**Never hardcode hex in view files.**

| Role | Token |
|------|-------|
| Canvas | `DesignTokens.canvasBase` |
| Panel | `DesignTokens.surfacePanel` |
| Divider | `DesignTokens.dividerStructural` |
| Text | `textPrimary` / `textSecondary` / `textDim` |
| Semantic | `statusGo` / `statusWarn` / `statusCritical` |
| Nav chrome | `accentRust` |
| Profile identity | `ProfileType.accentColor` |

**Deprecated:** `#0F1115`, `#1A1D24`, `#2E333F`, `#10B981`, `#D4AF37`, Inter font

## Layout Contract

- Shell: Nav 260pt | Center flex | Inspector 280pt | 1px dividers
- Row heights: 28pt data | 32pt buttons | 36pt CLI header | 40pt top bar
- Dashboard metrics: **4 fixed columns** — NOT adaptive grid
- Metric cell: label + value + 24pt sparkline slot = 56pt height
- Sheets: key-value rows (40/60 split, 28pt)

## Terminal Aesthetic

### CLI Headers
```
porteos@system ~ % profile --hospitality --asset="Casa Breiner"
```
Font: 11pt; command segment in profile accent

### Numbered Modules
```
01 // OPERATIONAL_STATS
02 // PROFITABILITY_MATRIX
```

### Buttons
- `[ ACTION ]` via `TerminalButtonStyle`
- Semantic: `.approve` / `.watchlist` / `.reject`
- No rounded corners, no SF Symbol-only buttons in chrome

## Component Authority

| Use | Component |
|-----|-----------|
| Module shell | `TerminalBlock` |
| List metrics | `TerminalMetricRow` |
| Grid metrics | `TerminalMetricCell` (when built) / `MetricGridCell` |
| Hero score | `PorteosScoreBlock` |
| Threshold gauge | `TerminalAsciiGauge` |
| Trend | `TerminalSparkline` |
| Tags | `TerminalTagChip` |
| AI analysis | `AIVibePanel` |

## Reject Immediately

- Rounded corners, shadows, gradients, glass blur
- Adaptive metric grids (`GridItem(.adaptive(...))`)
- Inline `Color(hex:)` in Views/
- Inter or SF Pro for UI text
- Semantic green/red on neutral metrics
- Missing CLI headers or numbered modules

## Enforcement

Violations will be rejected. When in doubt, read `DESIGN_EXECUTION_PLAN.md` Phase order.

All changes must pass `zero-defect-quality.mdc` gates before completion.
